Nilan integration for Home Assistant (DUC750/ha-nilan)

This product includes software developed by Taneli Veistinen (veista)
as the Home Assistant integration "nilan", https://github.com/veista/nilan,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Taken over from veista/nilan, via the modified fork DUC750/nilan:
  - the CTS602 register map (registers.py),
  - the entity map and device selection (device_map.py),
  - the register decoding (device.py, getters and setters),
  - the entity platforms and translations.

Changed in this repository (see README.md, "What changed"):
  - transport: Home Assistant's shared Modbus connection
    (homeassistant/components/modbus/connection.py) instead of the
    integration's own Modbus hub,
  - polling: one DataUpdateCoordinator reading the registers in blocks.
